stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Entry: BootHerdr / BootTmux / LiveTmux / DeadTmux / ProbeFail / HerdrBound / Unresolved / SlotGc / LegacyKey
    Entry --> KeyHolder: A2 / A6 / A9 hold a session key or the slot's thread id
    KeyHolder --> Tmux: After: the key finds the row (legacy key too); no row at all is nothing
    KeyHolder --> Hold: S1bFirst: token from the key or ProviderUnknown (slot binding refused)

    state "host_decision (row + tmux now, no cache)" as Decide
    Entry --> Decide: CmdRestart / CmdTmuxOp / CmdRelaunch / Input
    Decide --> Herdr: own boot Herdr, or Bound row at the parent's endpoint
    Decide --> Tmux: plain channel, tmux parent, live tmux, nothing runs
    Decide --> Hold: Unresolved, provider unknown, probe failed, row unknown

    Herdr --> [*]: A1 herdr::run, A2-A9 keep tmux, no relaunch, consent asked (Bound passes)
    Tmux --> [*]: A1 tmux restart, A2-A9 tmux path, relaunch applies, consent not asked
    Hold --> [*]: A1 refused (no host), A2-A9 keep tmux, no relaunch, consent not asked

    state "process record (thread_host JUDGED)" as Record
    Entry --> Record: Turn (for_turn)
    Record --> Record: gate refusal over a verified Bound row keeps Herdr (After)
    Record --> Empty: Restart (process memory)
    Empty --> Record: S2 BootRestore seeds Bound threads before readers
    Record --> SyncRead: #15 / #43 / #45 read Herdr -> Herdr path, else tmux path
    Empty --> SyncRead: Unknown -> tmux path (base behaviour)
